{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02931","headline":"寒食应制 · 韦承庆","name":"寒食应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤城春色晚，龙禁早晖通。\n旧火收槐燧，余寒入桂宫。\n莺啼正隐叶，鸡鬬始开笼。\n蔼蔼瑶山满，仙歌始乐风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦承庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}